    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/6/62/Libertiaqbulb.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240506233715\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Libertiaqbulb\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/6/62/Libertiaqbulb.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240506233715\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"944\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Libertiaqbulb.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Libertiaqbulb.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>交响旅行者</b>\n\n一个年轻女孩，作为吟游诗人在各地游历。\n\n</p><p>她总是随身携带心爱的乐器，用它演奏出抚慰人心的旋律。动物们总会因她的音乐而靠近并围绕在她身边。\n\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/1a/SLibertiaqbulb.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240506233714\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"SLibertiaqbulb\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/1a/SLibertiaqbulb.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240506233714\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"853\" height=\"2209\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"SLibertiaqbulb.jpg\" data-image-key=\"SLibertiaqbulb.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/9c/Libertia_Symphony_Traveler_Dancer_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260117003310\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Libertia Symphony Traveler Dancer Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/9c/Libertia_Symphony_Traveler_Dancer_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20260117003310\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"916\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Libertia Symphony Traveler Dancer Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Libertia_Symphony_Traveler_Dancer_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260820065630\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.007 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_queensblade:pcache:idhash:39716-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260820065630 and revision id 64742. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
